# The `hep-graphic` package

TikZ, pgfplots and tikz-feynman setup with externalisation and figure
inclusion helpers

## Introduction

The `hep-graphic` package collects graphics helpers for HEP documents. It
loads TikZ, optional TikZ externalisation, and `tikzscale`, provides
path-aware inclusion commands for generated PGF plots and Feynman
diagrams, and can load companion `hep-plot` and `hep-feynman` modules for
`pgfplots` defaults, colour cycles, line styles, legends, and
`tikz-feynman` settings.

It can be loaded with `\usepackage{hep-graphic}`. The `plot` option loads
the plot module, the `feynman` option loads the Feynman-diagram module,
and `extern=<folder>` activates TikZ externalisation into the selected
folder.

